  "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds `doc/2026-11-08_decision_id5909_sql_pgq_capability.md` with:\n\n- An engine capability matrix for SQLite, libSQL, and ID's current redb event store.\n- A typed, bounded translation profile and explicit unsupported-feature fallback, without expanding #5675/#5816 v1 beyond its no-joins query shape.\n- The three cyclic triple-index orders and a required rows-vs-document bake-off.\n\nNo implementation is included.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** #5909 had no capability decision record; `pkgs/id` uses redb for its production event store, with SQLite confined to a test/dev bridge.\n- **After:** the record links the source evidence and primary engine documentation, marks capabilities native/translated/unsupported, and records the query-surface compatibility check.\n- **Check:** `git diff --cached --check` — pass. Doc-only change; no code tests/builds applicable.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** documentation\n\nThe record authorizes no implementation and does not change runtime behavior.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796738078&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7714&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7714&signature=9f38c252cfe9bb0f52e81d3ca072f5f51e740e8d115e105343c7e68293dce906\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7714?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
